Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,920] | Elapsed:  17.23s | Words: 4  | Text: 什么叫财富
Segment #2   [00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:02,960] | Elapsed:  17.23s | Words: 12 | Text: 你节约下来的钱才是你的财富
Segment #3   [00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,220] | Elapsed:  17.23s | Words: 8  | Text: 你花掉的钱不是你的钱
Segment #4   [00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:06,180] | Elapsed:  17.24s | Words: 11 | Text: 你比如说你年薪就算一千万
Segment #5   [00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:07,680] | Elapsed:  17.24s | Words: 10 | Text: 你全花光了你也是个穷笔
Segment #6   [00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:10,300] | Elapsed:  17.24s | Words: 14 | Text: 你比如说你哪怕一个月只剩一万块钱
Segment #7   [00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,660] | Elapsed:  17.24s | Words: 9  | Text: 对吧 你能省下了五千
Segment #8   [00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:12,740] | Elapsed:  17.24s | Words: 7  | Text: 那你也是个有钱人
Segment #9   [00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:13,540] | Elapsed:  17.24s | Words: 4  | Text: 什么是富人
Segment #10  [00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:14,320] | Elapsed:  17.24s | Words: 3  | Text: 就是节约
Segment #11  [00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:15,840] | Elapsed:  17.24s | Words: 8  | Text: 一个花钱大数大小的人
Segment #12  [00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,640] | Elapsed:  17.24s | Words: 11 | Text: 那最终的结果一定是反评的
Segment #13  [00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:19,220] | Elapsed:  17.24s | Words: 9  | Text: 节约就是富人和资本家
Segment #14  [00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:20,720] | Elapsed:  17.24s | Words: 8  | Text: 应在学业里的铁律
Segment #15  [00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:22,260] | Elapsed:  17.24s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是钱可以花
Segment #16  [00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:23,260] | Elapsed:  17.24s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是不能浪费
Segment #17  [00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,720] | Elapsed:  17.24s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是我花的一定要有价值
Segment #18  [00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:26,680] | Elapsed:  17.24s | Words: 11 | Text: 任何证明自己的事情一律不干
Segment #19  [00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:28,760] | Elapsed:  17.24s | Words: 11 | Text: 任何的为情绪付费的这个事情
Segment #20  [00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:29,520] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 4  | Text: 那都是大片
Segment #21  [00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:30,640] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 这就是富人的习惯
Segment #22  [00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,740] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是穷人他不一样
Segment #23  [00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,360] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 穷人他就是无所谓
Segment #24  [00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:34,000] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 4  | Text: 他不在乎
Segment #25  [00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,100] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 所以说他活该穷
Segment #26  [00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:35,860] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 4  | Text: 这就是他的命
Segment #27  [00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:37,880] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 11 | Text: 因为穷人最喜欢干的事就是浪费
Segment #28  [00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:39,240] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 4  | Text: 什么9块9
Segment #29  [00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:40,120] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 3  | Text: 19块9
Segment #30  [00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:43,220] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 10 | Text: 这个看似很多花的毫不在意
Segment #31  [00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:44,780] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 但当他真的需要钱了
Segment #32  [00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:45,500] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 他再也不愿意
Segment #33  [00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,040] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 那也不愿意
Segment #34  [00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:46,760] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 4  | Text: 这就是穷人
Segment #35  [00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:48,740] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 12 | Text: 想成为富人第一个最重要的要素
Segment #36  [00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:51,060] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 13 | Text: 就是养成一个看重每一分钱的习惯
Segment #37  [00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:51,800] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 4  | Text: 这不是口号
Segment #38  [00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:52,480] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 4  | Text: 这是尊重钱
Segment #39  [00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:54,420] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 13 | Text: 因为有钱人都知道钱是来之不易的
Segment #40  [00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:55,640] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 钱是可以生钱的
Segment #41  [00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:56,960] | Elapsed:  37.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 你浪费了一个母亲
Segment #42  [00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:59,400] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 15 | Text: 有可能就会浪费了他后面的子子孙孙
Segment #43  [00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:01,020] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 9  | Text: 但是穷人他就没有这个概念
Segment #44  [00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:02,980] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 8  | Text: 他动不动就是353500
Segment #45  [00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:04,820] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 9  | Text: 在他眼里根本就不是钱
Segment #46  [00:01:04,820 --> 00:01:05,480] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 4  | Text: 那是数字
Segment #47  [00:01:05,480 --> 00:01:07,280] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 10 | Text: 但是他自己本身他又没有多少钱
Segment #48  [00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:08,560] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 9  | Text: 偏偏就看不上这3500
Segment #49  [00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:11,000] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 11 | Text: 所以说穷人穷的是非常有道理的
Segment #50  [00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,020] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为像我自己也一样
Segment #51  [00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:13,520] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 9  | Text: 我有过四次负债的经历
Segment #52  [00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:15,120] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 8  | Text: 当我再一次站起来的时候
Segment #53  [00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,820] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 9  | Text: 我就深刻的明白了一个道理
Segment #54  [00:01:16,820 --> 00:01:18,280] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是我没有能力
Segment #55  [00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:19,220] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 5  | Text: 我也不懂财务
Segment #56  [00:01:19,220 --> 00:01:19,960] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 5  | Text: 我也不懂管理
Segment #57  [00:01:19,960 --> 00:01:20,780] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 5  | Text: 我什么都不懂
Segment #58  [00:01:20,780 --> 00:01:23,280] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 11 | Text: 就是我过往赚到的每一分钱
Segment #59  [00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:25,140] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 9  | Text: 这全部是来自于我的运气
Segment #60  [00:01:25,140 --> 00:01:26,340] | Elapsed:  57.56s | Words: 8  | Text: 我只是站在了风口上
Segment #61  [00:01:26,340 --> 00:01:27,160] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 社会成就了
Segment #62  [00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:28,460] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 7  | Text: 是时代成就了我
Segment #63  [00:01:28,460 --> 00:01:30,140] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 11 | Text: 我只是一个什么都不懂的普通人
Segment #64  [00:01:30,140 --> 00:01:31,420] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 7  | Text: 然后我深刻理解到
Segment #65  [00:01:31,420 --> 00:01:32,680] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 9  | Text: 我必须要学会尊重钱
Segment #66  [00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:33,900] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 我的钱就是我的命
Segment #67  [00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:35,320] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 8  | Text: 我一定不能去拿我生存
Segment #68  [00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:36,220] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 7  | Text: 必须要用到的钱
Segment #69  [00:01:36,220 --> 00:01:38,000] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 11 | Text: 去拨一个我根本不需要的结果
Segment #70  [00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,100] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 8  | Text: 这句话也想送给大家
Segment #71  [00:01:39,100 --> 00:01:41,020] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 10 | Text: 这也是我想送给大家的一段话
Segment #72  [00:01:41,020 --> 00:01:42,680] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 10 | Text: 关键时刻真的能救你一命
Segment #73  [00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:43,900] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 你只有尊重钱
Segment #74  [00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:44,900] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 4  | Text: 钱才回来
Segment #75  [00:01:44,900 --> 00:01:46,100] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 很多时候不是花不起
Segment #76  [00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:46,840] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 4  | Text: 是没必要
Segment #77  [00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,580] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 4  | Text: 这不是口袍
Segment #78  [00:01:47,580 --> 00:01:48,380] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 3  | Text: 这是尊重
Segment #79  [00:01:48,380 --> 00:01:49,080] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 4  | Text: 在我们生人
Segment #80  [00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:50,240] | Elapsed:  75.05s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你们越来越好
